00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,500
僕たちは配信アプリ「ホロキャス」で活動する配信者。
We're streamers active on the streaming app HoloCast.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:09,500
突然画面に吸い込まれて、アプリと繋がる謎の世界「ホロキャス界」に来ちゃった！
Suddenly sucked into our screens, we ended up in the mysterious world connected to the app, the HoloCast Realm!

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,800
そこでは、現実で苦しむ人の魂が怪物化してしまう現象「ユメオチ」が起こっていた。
There, a phenomenon called Yumeochi was occurring, where souls of suffering people turned into monsters.

5
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:22,500
怪物コラプサーを倒して、みんなの魂を取り戻さないと！
We have to defeat the monster Collapsars and rescue everyone's souls!

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,500
そして、魔法少女に変身して戦うことになった。
And so, we transformed into magical girls to fight.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
みんなの心を助けて、夢を応援するの！
We save everyone's hearts and cheer on their dreams!

