160
00:11:17,929 --> 00:11:19,729
ちょ、ちょ、ちょ、ちょ！
W-W-Wait a minute!

161
00:11:19,729 --> 00:11:21,729
なになに！？ どういうこと！？
What is this!? What's going on!?

162
00:11:22,129 --> 00:11:23,429
コラプサーだ！
It's a Corruptor!

163
00:11:23,529 --> 00:11:24,929
ですよね！ どう考えてもね！
I knew it! No matter how you look at it!

164
00:11:25,129 --> 00:11:27,429
コラプサー... やっぱり
A Corruptor... Just as I thought.

165
00:11:35,929 --> 00:11:37,929
痛い痛い痛い！
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

166
00:11:41,429 --> 00:11:43,429
怖い怖い怖い！
Scary, scary, scary!

167
00:11:44,729 --> 00:11:46,729
えっ、えっと... こういう時は...
U-Um... at times like this...

168
00:11:47,929 --> 00:11:50,429
ト、トリック・オア・トリート！
T-Trick or treat!

169
00:11:50,429 --> 00:11:51,929
何もかも違うだろ
Everything about that is wrong.

170
00:12:02,429 --> 00:12:04,729
あがねー！ 魂が逆になってるよ！
Oh no! Her soul is coming out backwards!

171
00:12:05,929 --> 00:12:08,429
フブさん！
Fubu-san!

172
00:12:09,429 --> 00:12:12,429
出てる出てる！ 魂の尾っぽが出てる！
It's coming out! The tail of her soul is sticking out!

173
00:12:12,929 --> 00:12:14,429
よいしょー！
Heave-ho!

174
00:12:19,929 --> 00:12:24,429
だが、コラプサーが出てくるってことは...
But if a Corruptor is appearing here...

175
00:12:24,929 --> 00:12:27,929
ユメオチしてる人がいるんだ！ たぶん...
Someone is falling into despair! Probably...

176
00:12:31,729 --> 00:12:32,929
ミオ先輩！
Mio-senpai!

177
00:12:33,129 --> 00:12:34,429
ミオちゃん！
Mio-chan!

178
00:12:37,129 --> 00:12:38,729
ご、ごめん...
I-I'm sorry...

179
00:12:38,929 --> 00:12:42,429
うち... うち、本当は...
I... I actually...

180
00:12:43,429 --> 00:12:47,429
ハロウィンのカボチャが怖くてダメなのー！
I'm terrified of Halloween pumpkins!

181
00:12:48,129 --> 00:12:49,129
えっ？
Eh?

182
00:12:50,929 --> 00:12:55,929
ちっちゃい頃、パパがハロウィンであれ被って帰ってきて...
When I was little, my dad came home wearing one of those for Halloween...

183
00:12:56,929 --> 00:12:58,129
ただいまー
[Dad]: I'm home~

184
00:12:58,129 --> 00:13:00,929
うち、パパがカボチャに食べられちゃったんだって思っちゃって...
I thought my dad had been eaten by a pumpkin...

185
00:13:00,929 --> 00:13:02,429
ハッピーハロウィーン！！
[Dad]: Happy Halloween!!

186
00:13:02,929 --> 00:13:04,929
それから...
Ever since then...

187
00:13:06,929 --> 00:13:08,929
どうしても...
No matter what...

188
00:13:10,429 --> 00:13:16,429
ハロウィンのカボチャだけは、無理なの〜！
...Halloween pumpkins are just too much for me!

189
00:13:37,429 --> 00:13:39,929
いやーー！
Nooo!

190
00:13:42,929 --> 00:13:43,929
チェンジ！
Change!

191
00:13:44,429 --> 00:13:45,929
ガーディアン・アーム！
Guardian Arm!

192
00:13:46,129 --> 00:13:47,729
ミコメロ・ロッド！
Mikomelo Rod!

193
00:13:47,929 --> 00:13:50,729
キャンディ・パラソル！
Candy Parasol!

194
00:13:50,929 --> 00:13:52,929
ガンバリナー！
Ganbarina!

195
00:13:53,129 --> 00:13:54,929
スノーフレーク・セイバー！
Snowflake Saber!

196
00:13:55,129 --> 00:13:56,729
吹雪丸！
Fubukimaru!

197
00:13:56,929 --> 00:13:58,929
ここは任せて、ミオ！
Leave this to us, Mio!

198
00:13:59,429 --> 00:14:00,929
みんな...
Everyone...

199
00:14:03,929 --> 00:14:07,929
魔法、みんなに見せちゃうけど、いいよね！
We're showing everyone our magic, but that's okay, right?!

200
00:14:08,129 --> 00:14:11,729
うん！ そんなこと言ってらんないし！
Yeah! We don't have time to worry about that!

201
00:14:11,929 --> 00:14:15,929
だよね！ ユメオチした人を助ける、それが...
That's right! Saving people who've fallen into despair, that is...

202
00:14:16,429 --> 00:14:20,429
魔法少女、ホロウィッチ！
Magical Girls, HoloWitches!

203
00:14:21,429 --> 00:14:25,429
この手を差し伸べて 掴んで 握る！
Reach out this hand, grab on, hold tight!

204
00:14:25,429 --> 00:14:28,429
天使のホロ！ 魔法少女かなた！
Angel Holo! Magical Girl Kanata!

205
00:14:29,429 --> 00:14:32,929
みんなの願いを咲かせる祈り！
A prayer to make everyone's wishes bloom!

206
00:14:32,929 --> 00:14:36,429
巫女のホロ！ 魔法少女みこ！
Shrine Maiden Holo! Magical Girl Miko!

207
00:14:37,429 --> 00:14:41,429
甘い幸せ お裾分け！
Sharing a slice of sweet happiness!

208
00:14:41,429 --> 00:14:44,929
姫のホロ！ 魔法少女ルーナ！
Princess Holo! Magical Girl Luna!

209
00:14:46,429 --> 00:14:49,429
煌めくお宝 ドッキュン！
Sparkling treasure, bang!

210
00:14:49,429 --> 00:14:52,929
海賊のホロ！ 魔法少女マリン！
Pirate Holo! Magical Girl Marine!

211
00:14:54,429 --> 00:14:57,729
心踊らすトリックスター！
The heart-thrilling trickster!

212
00:14:57,729 --> 00:15:00,929
狐のホロ！ 魔法少女フブキ！
Fox Holo! Magical Girl Fubuki!

213
00:15:02,777 --> 00:15:04,577
積もり重なる純白の愛
Piling up, pure white love...

214
00:15:04,777 --> 00:15:05,977
雪のホロ
Holo of snow...

215
00:15:06,277 --> 00:15:07,777
魔法少女ラミィ！
Magical Girl Lamy!

216
00:15:09,277 --> 00:15:10,577
ホロウィッチ！
HoloWitches!

217
00:15:11,277 --> 00:15:12,777
フルキャスト！
Full Cast!

218
00:15:14,977 --> 00:15:16,577
行くよー！
Here I go!

219
00:15:17,277 --> 00:15:19,277
はい！ はい！ はい！
Ha! Ha! Ha!

220
00:15:23,577 --> 00:15:26,577
パンプ... 敵じゃないよ、仲間だよ
Pump... I'm not an enemy, I'm a friend!

221
00:15:27,777 --> 00:15:28,777
コン！
Kon!

222
00:15:34,977 --> 00:15:36,277
やめな！
Stop it!

223
00:15:37,277 --> 00:15:38,277
せい！
Sei!

224
00:16:03,277 --> 00:16:04,777
おいおいおい...
Hey, hey, hey...

225
00:16:23,577 --> 00:16:26,777
な、なんかこれまずくない？ どんどん強くなってる...
W-Wait, isn't this bad? They're getting stronger...

226
00:16:27,277 --> 00:16:30,977
みんなが奴らを倒すより、不安と恐れが膨れ上がる方が早いみたい！
Anxiety and fear are growing faster than everyone can defeat them!

227
00:16:31,277 --> 00:16:33,277
そんな...
No way...

228
00:16:33,777 --> 00:16:36,277
うちのせい...
It's my fault...

229
00:16:39,977 --> 00:16:43,777
うちが... あんなもの怖いって思っちゃうせいで...
Because I... felt scared of things like that...

230
00:16:44,277 --> 00:16:45,777
そんなこと...
That's not...

231
00:16:45,977 --> 00:16:47,277
わかってるの...
I know...

232
00:16:47,577 --> 00:16:52,277
おかしいよね... あんなのが、こんな、どうしようもなく怖いなんて...
It's weird, right? Being so helplessly scared of something like that...

233
00:16:53,277 --> 00:17:00,277
だから... 今日も我慢して、頑張ろうって思ったのに...
That's why... I told myself I'd endure it and try my best today too...

234
00:17:01,277 --> 00:17:04,277
でも... でもやっぱり...
But... But still...

235
00:17:04,577 --> 00:17:06,277
おかしくなんてないよ。
There's nothing weird about it.

236
00:17:08,277 --> 00:17:09,577
カノンさん...
Qon-san...

237
00:17:09,977 --> 00:17:16,577
誰にだって、苦手なものがある。怖いもの、嫌いなもの。
Everyone has weaknesses. Things they fear, things they dislike.

238
00:17:17,277 --> 00:17:24,277
人に「なんでそんなものが？」って言われても、どうしようもないことって、やっぱりあるよ。
Even if others ask 'Why are you afraid of that?', there are just things you can't help.

239
00:17:28,777 --> 00:17:29,977
そうだよ！
That's right!

240
00:17:30,277 --> 00:17:34,577
何が苦手とか何が怖いとかは関係なくて！
It doesn't matter what you're bad at or afraid of!

241
00:17:34,777 --> 00:17:39,277
大事なのは今、ミオちゃんが辛いって思ってるってことだから！
What matters is that right now, Mio-chan is suffering!

242
00:17:40,277 --> 00:17:41,777
遠慮しないで...
Don't hold back...

243
00:17:44,577 --> 00:17:46,277
頼ってほしいのら！
We want you to rely on us!

244
00:17:47,777 --> 00:17:49,577
だって、そうやってさ...
Because, after all...

245
00:17:50,277 --> 00:17:53,277
うちら、お互い様じゃん！
we support each other!

246
00:17:53,577 --> 00:17:55,777
誰かの辛さや誰かの苦手は...
Someone's pain or someone's weakness...

247
00:17:55,977 --> 00:17:58,577
他の誰かがカバーする！
will be covered by someone else!

248
00:17:58,777 --> 00:18:00,577
お互いそうやって...
That's how we've all...

249
00:18:00,777 --> 00:18:03,577
やってきたんだから！ 今だって...
gotten by! Even now...

250
00:18:07,777 --> 00:18:09,777
こんなに頑張れる！
we can fight this hard!

251
00:18:12,777 --> 00:18:15,777
ホロウィッチ... コラップサーは...
HoloWitches... The Corruptors are...

252
00:18:15,977 --> 00:18:19,277
夢落ちした人の恐れと不安から生まれ...
born from the fear and anxiety of those who fell into Dreamfall...

253
00:18:19,777 --> 00:18:22,777
その心を深く沈ませる。
sinking their hearts deep down into darkness.

254
00:18:23,777 --> 00:18:25,577
夢落ちって...
Dreamfall...?

255
00:18:25,777 --> 00:18:26,977
どうしてそれを...？
How do you know that...?

256
00:18:27,277 --> 00:18:30,777
でも... 私は知ってる。
But... I know.

257
00:18:31,777 --> 00:18:34,977
君たちなら... ホロウィッチなら...
If it's you... If it's the HoloWitches...

258
00:18:35,777 --> 00:18:39,977
辛い、苦しい、悲しい、きつい...
Painful, agonizing, sad, tough...

259
00:18:40,277 --> 00:18:45,777
そんな、自分一人の力じゃ抜け出せない暗闇の中にいても...
Even in a darkness so deep you can't escape on your own...

260
00:18:46,777 --> 00:18:50,277
夢へ... 光を届けてくれる！
you will deliver light... to their dreams!

261
00:18:51,577 --> 00:18:53,577
任せて！
Leave it to us!

262
00:18:59,977 --> 00:19:01,777
さあ、みんな。
Now, everyone.

263
00:19:01,977 --> 00:19:04,777
ホロウィッチが戦ってくれる。
The HoloWitches are fighting for us.

264
00:19:05,277 --> 00:19:07,777
では、私達にできるのは？
So, what is it that we can do?

265
00:19:08,277 --> 00:19:10,577
そう... 私達の声で...
That's right... With our voices...

266
00:19:10,777 --> 00:19:12,577
思いで！
With our feelings!

267
00:19:12,777 --> 00:19:15,977
彼女たちを応援することだ！
To cheer them on!

268
00:19:17,277 --> 00:19:20,277
いざ！ トリック・オア・トリート！
Now then! Trick or Treat!

269
00:19:24,277 --> 00:19:28,277
仮装狂騒曲
[Song: Masquerade Rhapsody]

270
00:19:30,277 --> 00:19:35,277
あれよと言う間に 飲み込まれる
橙色のタイダルウェーブ 夜行夜光
Swallowed up in the blink of an eye,
an orange tidal wave, nocturnal night lights.

271
00:19:36,277 --> 00:19:39,277
ハンドメイドから オーダーメイドまで
仕掛ける大流行
From handmade to custom order,
launching a grand craze.

272
00:19:39,777 --> 00:19:42,777
本物から偽物まで まとめ大集合
From the real deal to fakes,
a massive gathering altogether.

273
00:19:43,277 --> 00:19:45,977
揃いも揃って不揃いの世界観に
お揃いの幼稚さに辟易な恒例
In a world view where all are misfits,
tired of the standard matching childishness.

274
00:19:46,277 --> 00:19:49,777
催しの奴隷 夜通し踊れ
条例処刑フォーメーションで 褒美を獲れ
Slaves to the event, dance all night long,
in execution formation, claim your reward.

275
00:19:50,277 --> 00:19:54,277
マーマレードが溶ける頃
キャパ以上にお道化る者
Around the time marmalade melts,
those who play the fool beyond their capacity.

276
00:19:54,777 --> 00:19:56,977
チヤホヤしたりされたりが いいんでしょ？
Flattering and being flattered feels good, right?

277
00:19:57,277 --> 00:19:59,777
甘い だけじゃ 物足りない give me some more
Just sweet isn't enough, give me some more.

278
00:20:01,192 --> 00:20:02,592
邪気に呑まれ 制御不能
Swallowed up and out of control by malice,

279
00:20:02,592 --> 00:20:03,992
好きに奪い去る 異議マイナス 陰気
Snatching away as they please, minus objections, gloom.

280
00:20:03,992 --> 00:20:05,692
バイラル 意に介さず イニミニマニモ
Viral, paying no heed, eeny, meeny, miny, moe.

281
00:20:05,692 --> 00:20:07,592
恐ろしや 漫ろ
How terrifying, wandering aimlessly.

282
00:20:07,592 --> 00:20:09,092
浮かび上がり回る月に針が落ちる
The needle drops on the floating, revolving moon.

283
00:20:09,092 --> 00:20:11,792
大きな口で笑うカボチャたちが歌う
Pumpkins with huge smiling mouths sing out.

284
00:20:11,792 --> 00:20:14,392
それが合図 魔物たちが目覚め踊る
That's the signal, monsters awaken and dance!

285
00:20:14,392 --> 00:20:17,892
こうなればあとは思いのまま
Once it gets like this, all that's left is to have our way.

286
00:20:17,892 --> 00:20:22,392
翻弄 骨抜き danceable
Tricked, demoralized, danceable.

287
00:20:22,392 --> 00:20:26,592
スケアクロウも飛び跳ね廻る
Even the scarecrow leaps and dances around.

288
00:20:26,592 --> 00:20:29,392
hollow 月夜の turntable
A turntable in the hollow moonlit night.

289
00:20:29,392 --> 00:20:32,892
くるくる狂おしい高まり
Spinning, spinning, a crazy surge of excitement!

290
00:20:32,892 --> 00:20:35,892
We got the party night!

291
00:20:40,392 --> 00:20:43,692
Anyway, enjoy the party night!

292
00:20:43,692 --> 00:20:46,592
フルーティー無邪気な空気じゃ無理
A fruity, innocent vibe just won't cut it.

293
00:20:46,592 --> 00:20:50,392
贅沢に清濁をチェイサーなしでいただけばヘラヘラ
Downing sweet and bitter luxury without a chaser, grinning away.

294
00:20:50,392 --> 00:20:53,392
Where is my 素敵なナイト 見つからなくても既に薔薇色
Where is my wonderful knight? Even if I can't find one, it's already rose-colored.

295
00:20:53,392 --> 00:20:56,292
嫉妬は見苦しいから着ぐるみに指定してから
Jealousy is unsightly, so I'll stuff it into a mascot costume...

296
00:20:56,292 --> 00:20:59,392
剥いであげる身包み
...and strip away its pretense!

297
00:20:59,392 --> 00:21:02,392
仮の衣装でも魂が本物ならば
Even in a temporary costume, if the soul is genuine...

298
00:21:02,392 --> 00:21:05,492
魅了してイマジナリー以上
...it'll enchant you beyond imagination.

299
00:21:05,492 --> 00:21:09,092
死霊生霊構わず邂逅
Spirits of the dead or living, meeting without care.

300
00:21:09,092 --> 00:21:12,592
とびきりの美貌 ハッピーな非日常
Extraordinary beauty, a happy non-everyday life.

301
00:21:12,592 --> 00:21:15,792
ガラパゴスに交わる異世界大交流パーティー
An otherworldly grand exchange party intersecting in Galapagos!

302
00:21:15,792 --> 00:21:18,792
振り切れる鼓動
A heart beating off the charts!

303
00:21:18,792 --> 00:21:21,592
悪目立ちのドラキュラもお酒を煽る
Even the flashy Dracula downs his drink!

304
00:21:21,592 --> 00:21:24,492
寡黙そうなデュラハンも頭を振る
Even the quiet-looking Dullahan headbangs!

305
00:21:24,492 --> 00:21:27,392
紳士的なミイラすらも服がはだける
Even the gentlemanly Mummy strips off his clothes!

306
00:21:27,392 --> 00:21:30,592
どうあれど愉快全開のまま
Whatever happens, staying at full delight!

307
00:21:30,592 --> 00:21:32,092
本性 露わに暴れよう
Let's expose our true nature and go wild!

308
00:21:32,092 --> 00:21:33,592
その仮装も正装になる
Even those costumes will become formal wear!

309
00:21:33,592 --> 00:21:37,592
狂騒曲の turntable
Turntable of the rhapsody!

310
00:21:37,592 --> 00:21:40,592
あいあい愛おしい高まり
Dear, precious excitement!

311
00:21:40,592 --> 00:21:44,792
hi-fi, all night all night

312
00:21:44,792 --> 00:21:49,392
眠れやしない woo la la la...
Can't sleep at all, woo la la la...

313
00:21:49,392 --> 00:21:53,092
fly high, all night all night

314
00:21:53,092 --> 00:21:57,092
鳴り止まない woo la la la...
It won't stop ringing, woo la la la...

315
00:21:57,092 --> 00:21:59,792
誇大妄想な遊び
A game of grandiose delusions.

316
00:21:59,792 --> 00:22:03,592
ランタンはまるで魂 依然奇怪なジャンボリー
Lanterns are like souls, still a bizarre jamboree!

317
00:22:03,592 --> 00:22:06,192
let me hear you say ハロウィン
Let me hear you say Halloween!

318
00:22:06,192 --> 00:22:10,592
翻弄 骨抜き danceable
Tricked, demoralized, danceable.

319
00:22:10,592 --> 00:22:14,792
スケアクロウも飛び跳ね廻る
Even the scarecrow leaps and dances around.

320
00:22:14,792 --> 00:22:17,592
hollow 月夜の turntable
A turntable in the hollow moonlit night.

321
00:22:17,592 --> 00:22:21,092
くるくる狂おしい高まり
Spinning, spinning, a crazy surge of excitement!

322
00:22:21,092 --> 00:22:23,792
we got the party night!

323
00:22:23,792 --> 00:22:27,092
anyway, enjoy the party night!

324
00:22:27,092 --> 00:22:30,592
くるくる狂おしい高まり
Spinning, spinning, a crazy surge of excitement!

325
00:22:30,592 --> 00:22:34,092
we got the party night night night!

326
00:22:37,092 --> 00:22:39,592
ホロックス様の力が乱れている！
Lord HoloX's power is going wild!

327
00:22:39,592 --> 00:22:42,592
恐れと不安が溶けていくんだ...
Our fear and anxiety are melting away...

328
00:22:42,592 --> 00:22:46,592
歌の力...！みんなの声の力で...！
By the power of song...! The power of everyone's voices...!

329
00:22:46,592 --> 00:22:50,592
みんな乗ってるねー！
Everyone's really getting into it!

330
00:22:50,592 --> 00:22:56,092
おかげでこっちもやる気いっぱいなのナ！
Thanks to that, we're totally pumped up too!

331
00:22:56,092 --> 00:23:02,092
さあ、行って！ホロウィッチ！心を苛むトリックに！
Now, go! HoloWitch! Against the trick that torments hearts!

332
