That means...

507
00:42:31,611 --> 00:42:33,311
それって...
That means...

508
00:42:33,811 --> 00:42:36,811
それって、すっごく...
That's super...

509
00:42:36,811 --> 00:42:41,311
すっごくトリィト！
Super Treat!

510
00:43:10,711 --> 00:43:16,011
キラキラ 宝石みたいに輝いてる
Sparkling, shining like jewels,

511
00:43:16,011 --> 00:43:21,211
夢の結晶 みんなの宝物
crystals of dreams are everyone's treasure.

512
00:43:21,211 --> 00:43:26,711
時々見失っちゃうこともあるけど
Though sometimes we lose sight of them,

513
00:43:26,711 --> 00:43:32,611
溢れ出した光が僕を呼んだんだよ
the overflowing light called out to me.

514
00:43:33,611 --> 00:43:36,011
絶対 大丈夫
It's definitely okay.

515
00:43:36,011 --> 00:43:44,311
ただまっすぐでいることも楽じゃない日もあるよね
There are days when staying true isn't easy either, right?

516
00:43:44,811 --> 00:43:51,011
諦めも 苦しみも隠さなくていい
You don't have to hide giving up or suffering,

517
00:43:51,011 --> 00:43:54,811
心解き放とう
let's set your heart free.

518
00:43:54,811 --> 00:44:00,611
夢を歌おう 魔法に乗せて
Let's sing of dreams, carried on magic!

519
00:44:00,611 --> 00:44:06,011
何度も立ち上がる 君と一緒に進んでいく
Rising up again and again, I'll move forward together with you.

520
00:44:06,011 --> 00:44:10,611
夢は 夢は まだ終わらない
Dreams, dreams are not over yet!

521
00:44:10,611 --> 00:44:15,311
未来を取り戻そう
Let's reclaim the future!

522
00:44:15,311 --> 00:44:23,011
何度だって笑ってもう一回歩きはじめよう
Smiling time after time, let's take a step forward once more.

523
00:44:23,011 --> 00:44:26,611
ホロウィッチ on your side
Holowitch on your side

524
00:44:26,611 --> 00:44:29,811
夢の先へ
To what lies beyond dreams!

525
00:44:42,311 --> 00:44:47,311
ワクワクするような日々と夢の結晶
Thrilling days and crystals of dreams,

526
00:44:47,311 --> 00:44:52,811
思い出して魔法を唱えてみたら
if you remember and try chanting magic,

527
00:44:52,811 --> 00:44:58,811
ドキドキするような君の物語
your heart-pounding story...

528
00:45:00,919 --> 00:45:04,319
キラリキラリ出す日常
Everyday life starting to sparkle,

529
00:45:04,619 --> 00:45:07,719
頑張ってみても
Even when I try my best,

530
00:45:07,719 --> 00:45:11,319
上手くいかない日の方が
there seem to be more days

531
00:45:11,319 --> 00:45:15,119
多く感じちゃったりするよね
when things just don't go right.

532
00:45:15,619 --> 00:45:20,919
だけど不安も悲しみも抱えないで
But don't hold on to your anxieties and sadness,

533
00:45:20,919 --> 00:45:25,619
ひとりじゃない
you're not alone.

534
00:45:26,319 --> 00:45:29,619
希望の種を
If we sow the seeds of hope

535
00:45:29,619 --> 00:45:32,119
明日に蒔いたら
for tomorrow,

536
00:45:32,119 --> 00:45:37,319
一番に輝く綺麗なお花が咲くよ
a beautiful flower will bloom, shining brightest of all.

537
00:45:37,919 --> 00:45:41,319
夢を 歌を
Carrying our dreams, our songs,

538
00:45:41,319 --> 00:45:44,919
魔法に乗せて
on magic,

539
00:45:44,919 --> 00:45:48,619
何度も立ち上がる
we'll rise up again and again,

540
00:45:48,619 --> 00:45:53,119
君と一緒に進んでく
and move forward together with you.

541
00:45:53,319 --> 00:45:58,119
夢は 夢は 終わらない
Our dreams, our dreams will never end,

542
00:45:58,119 --> 00:46:05,619
未来を音に描こう
let me draw the future into sound.

543
00:46:05,919 --> 00:46:07,919
何度だって
No matter how many times,

544
00:46:07,919 --> 00:46:09,319
笑って
laugh,

545
00:46:09,319 --> 00:46:10,919
もう一回
and once more,

546
00:46:10,919 --> 00:46:14,119
歩き始めよう
let's start walking again.

547
00:46:14,119 --> 00:46:16,919
ホロウィッチ おいでよ
Holowitches, come along,

548
00:46:16,919 --> 00:46:21,919
夢の先へ
beyond our dreams!

